{"text": "SP =\nKI Key yall ~\n\"Tobacco Company\n\n910-741-5000\nWinston-Salem, N.C. 27102\n\nFebruary 5, 1996\n\nMr. C.J. Blache\nBreazeale Sachse & Wilson\nOne American Place, 23rd Floor\nP.O. Box3197*\nBaton Rouge, LA 70821\n\nDear C. J.:\n\nPlease find enclosed a folder of the \u201cWe Card\u201d program you have probably heard\nabout over the last several weeks. This is the industry\u2019s unified program to decrease\nyouth access to tobacco products. The program is geared to retailer training to stop\npoint-of-sale access.\n\nBecause thousands of these same brochures are currently being mailed to retailers all\nover the country, we wanted you to have one and be able to familiarize yourself with\nwhat is out there. As you will see as you read this material, the retailer can order a\n\u201cWe Card\u201d kit to be used in his place or places of business.\nWe obviously think this is a good program and just reiterates our strong views on\nyouth's access to tobacco products. If you should have any questions regarding this\nprogram, please give me a call.\n\u2018As always, thanks for the fine job you continue to do for RJR.\n\nSincerely,\n\nJoseph S. Murray, IIT\nRegional Director\nState Government Relations\nJSM,III/jpa\n\nEnclosure\n\nS\u20acEO TILTS\n\n\u201cWe work for smokers.\u201d", "words": [{"text": "SP", "x0": 59, "y0": 63, "x1": 108, "y1": 94, "conf": 85.0}, {"text": "=", "x0": 714, "y0": 71, "x1": 722, "y1": 75, "conf": 42.0}, {"text": "KI", "x0": 63, "y0": 63, "x1": 118, "y1": 133, "conf": 71.0}, {"text": "Key", "x0": 140, "y0": 63, "x1": 205, "y1": 133, "conf": 43.0}, {"text": "yall", "x0": 188, "y0": 63, "x1": 269, "y1": 114, "conf": 16.0}, {"text": "~", "x0": 290, "y0": 81, "x1": 304, "y1": 90, "conf": 58.0}, {"text": "\"Tobacco", "x0": 202, "y0": 115, "x1": 247, "y1": 125, "conf": 66.0}, {"text": "Company", "x0": 250, "y0": 113, "x1": 304, "y1": 126, "conf": 91.0}, {"text": "910-741-5000", "x0": 533, "y0": 150, "x1": 600, "y1": 161, "conf": 78.0}, {